              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "C3ekX",
                  "name": "emph",
                  "fill": "#081B52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 840,
                  "content": "無香料という選択から始まった、\nESION誕生のストーリーです。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                  "fontSize": 34,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mCGsP",
                  "name": "en",
                  "fill": "#5E6E96",
                  "content": "It began with a single choice — to carry no scent.",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 9,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "S5q9e",
              "name": "p",
              "fill": "#3D4655",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "洗い心地や仕上がりが気に入っても、香りが合わなければ、毎日使い続けることはできません。",
              "lineHeight": 2,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 16.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "iXxKd",
              "name": "p",
              "fill": "#3D4655",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "だからESIONは、香りで印象をつくるのではなく、シャンプーの本質である「必要なうるおいを守りながら、においの原因となる皮脂や汚れを洗い流すこと。」に向き合いました。",
              "lineHeight": 2,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 16.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "a75HfA",
              "name": "p",
              "fill": "#3D4655",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "香料を配合しないだけでなく、原料由来のにおいも感じない状態を目指すこと。",
              "lineHeight": 2,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 16.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
