                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "XT6zS",
                  "x": 84,
                  "y": 296.5,
                  "name": "body",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "height": "fit_content(321)",
                  "layout": "none"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "W7Kh5",
                  "x": 465,
                  "y": 56,
                  "name": "h",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 60,
                  "content": "強い香りが、苦手だった。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.1,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "k5ODJf",
                  "x": 542,
                  "y": 63.5,
                  "name": "label",
                  "rotation": -90,
                  "fill": "#9FB6CC",
                  "content": "CHAPTER 01",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 3
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y926us",
                  "x": 392,
                  "y": 64,
                  "name": "p",
                  "rotation": -90,
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "私は以前から、香りの強いシャンプーや洗顔料を使うと、くしゃみや鼻水が出ることがありました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y3t4P",
                  "x": 314,
                  "y": 64,
                  "name": "p",
                  "rotation": -90,
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "香りは製品を選ぶ楽しみの一つですが、毎日使うものの香りが負担になる人もいます。私自身が、その一人でした。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "t7VWTw",
                  "x": 236,
                  "y": 64,
                  "name": "p",
                  "rotation": -90,
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "無香料の製品を探すようになりましたが、すでにある無香料シャンプーは、泡立ちが物足りなかったり、洗髪中や洗い流した後に髪のきしみを感じたりすることがありました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zmcAQ",
                  "x": 129,
                  "y": 64,
                  "name": "p",
                  "rotation": -90,
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "「無香料だから、ある程度は仕方がない」。そう思いながら選ぶことに、違和感が残っていました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "rl7bU",
          "name": "CHAPTER 02",
          "clip": true,
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 741,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
