              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "name": "text",
              "width": 639,
              "height": "fit_content(607)",
              "layout": "none",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "iwZoa",
                  "x": 96,
                  "y": 88,
                  "name": "head",
                  "width": "fill_container(447)",
                  "height": "fit_content(164)",
                  "layout": "none",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "P01Ho",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 0,
                      "name": "label",
                      "fill": "#0D41A8",
                      "content": "CHAPTER 02",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": 3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mJ5rR",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 33,
                      "name": "h",
                      "fill": "#081B52",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container(447)",
                      "content": "家族で使える\n一本をつくりたい。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                      "fontSize": 36,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "f5vI48",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 153,
                      "name": "en",
                      "fill": "#5E6E96",
                      "content": "A single bottle the whole family can share.",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                      "fontSize": 9,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.5
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Xxroc",
                  "x": 96,
                  "y": 279,
                  "name": "body",
                  "width": 518,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 19,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wFkZ0",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#3D4655",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "家庭では、家族それぞれが別のシャンプーを使っていました。香りの好みも、求める洗い心地も違う。気がつけば、浴室には何本ものボトルが並んでいました。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nU6GC",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#3D4655",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "一人ひとりが好きなものを選ぶことは大切です。それでも、香りの好みに左右されず、家族みんなが同じ一本を使えたら、毎日の入浴はもっとシンプルになるのではないか。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "TRPvH",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#3D4655",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "そこで掲げた開発テーマは、無香料でありながら、洗い心地や髪の仕上がりにも妥協せず、家族みんなで使える一本をつくること。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "OGq1L",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#3D4655",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "豊かな泡立ちとなめらかな洗い心地、洗い流した後の指通りやまとまりまで。幼児から大人までが無理なく使い続けられ、浴室の何本ものボトルを一本にできる。そんなシャンプーを目指しました。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "nP0H5",
