            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "I0FJcF",
              "name": "h",
              "fill": "#FFFFFF",
              "content": "ESIONという名前",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
              "fontSize": 40,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cbOxk",
              "name": "en",
              "fill": "#FFFFFFB3",
              "content": "Read in reverse, ESION becomes NOISE.",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-en",
              "fontSize": 9,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1.5
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "bVhrC",
              "name": "sp",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 14
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NFbfj",
              "name": "typo",
              "gap": 34,
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UbdAb",
                  "name": "e",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                  "content": "ESION",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 78,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 6
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XenHQ",
                  "name": "arrow",
                  "fill": "#6FA8FF",
                  "content": "⇄",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mpmEo",
                  "name": "n",
                  "fill": "#3E5F92",
                  "content": "NOISE",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 78,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s1wMw",
              "name": "cap",
              "fill": "#9FB6CC",
              "content": "ESION を逆から読むと、NOISE。",
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "t1iCi",
              "name": "sp2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": 18
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "t8irEQ",
              "name": "body",
              "width": 720,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 22,
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CfpPO",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ESIONは、「本質」を意味するEssenceと、「見通し」を意味するVisionを組み合わせた造語です。\nこの名前には、「本質を追求する」という思いを込めています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ei5is",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "そしてESIONを逆から読むと「NOISE」。雑音のことです。\n流行や先入観、必要以上の情報によって、本当に大切なものが見えにくくなることがあります。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "u8xJnG",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "その雑音を取り除き、本質を見極める。\nESIONとNOISEは、私たちが目指すものと、その反対側にあるものを表しています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "bwXcF",
          "name": "CHAPTER 03",
          "clip": true,
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content(908)",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QrRAl",
              "x": 120,
              "y": 116,
              "name": "head",
              "width": "fill_container(959)",
              "height": "fit_content(96)",
              "layout": "none",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sUWCD",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "label",
                  "fill": "#0D41A8",
                  "content": "CHAPTER 03",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 3
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CN8Ma",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 35,
                  "name": "h",
                  "fill": "#081B52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 840,
                  "content": "無香料は、香料を抜くだけではない。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                  "fontSize": 42,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZvzlO",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 104,
                  "name": "en",
                  "fill": "#5E6E96",
                  "content": "Fragrance-free is more than removing fragrance.",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 9,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "b9ZuQ",
              "x": 120,
              "y": 252,
              "name": "body",
              "width": 602,
              "height": "fit_content(540)",
              "layout": "none",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "aiiW5",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "無香料とは、香料を配合していないこと。無香性とは、においがしないこと。ESIONが目指したのは、香料を配合しない「無香料」にとどまらず、においがしない「無香性」でした。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dIH1p",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 84,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "しかし、香料を配合しない処方にすると、これまで香料に隠れていた原料そのもののにおいが気になるようになりました。原料由来のにおいを香料で覆い隠さず、においを感じにくい原料で処方を組み立てることは、想像以上に困難でした。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wQ6UN",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 198,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "条件を満たす原料は限られています。一つひとつの原料のにおいを確かめながら、原料の選定、組み合わせ、配合バランスを見直していきました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gY0QL",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 282,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "ようやくにおいを抑えられても、原料を変更することで、泡立ちや洗い上がりまで変わってしまうことがあります。泡立ちだけを良くしても、理想の洗い上がりにはならない。指通りだけを重視しても、求める洗い心地には届かない。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rM4wa",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 396,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "無香性を目指しながら、泡立ち、洗浄力、指通り、まとまりを両立させるために、何度も何度も試作と改良を繰り返しました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z456W",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 480,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#3D4655",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(617)",
                  "content": "エシオンの価格には、香料で原料由来のにおいを覆い隠すのではなく、原料そのものからにおいに向き合うために必要となったコストも含まれています。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 15.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "Pt0ym",
              "x": 787,
              "y": 252,
              "fill": {
                "type": "image",
                "enabled": true,
