          ],
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "vh123",
              "name": "emphgroup",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mI0cd",
                  "name": "emph",
                  "fill": "#081B52",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                  "width": 840,
                  "height": 110,
                  "content": "無香料という選択から始まった、\nESION誕生のストーリーです。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                  "fontSize": 34,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XwFMw",
                  "name": "en",
                  "fill": "#5E6E96",
                  "content": "It began with a single choice — to carry no scent.",
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 9,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JFxvk",
              "name": "p",
              "fill": "#3D4655",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "洗い心地や仕上がりが気に入っても、香りが合わなければ、毎日使い続けることはできません。",
              "lineHeight": 2,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "F7gHNp",
              "name": "p",
              "fill": "#3D4655",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "だからESIONは、香りで印象をつくるのではなく、シャンプーの本質である「必要なうるおいを守りながら、においの原因となる皮脂や汚れを洗い流すこと」に向き合いました。",
              "lineHeight": 2,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "iYVCX",
              "name": "sp",
              "width": 12,
              "height": 14
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wEyvP",
          "name": "CHAPTER 01",
          "clip": true,
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 692,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "nJCcs",
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "name": "img",
              "fill": "#DDE2E9",
              "width": 1199,
              "height": 692
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "LQGKg",
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "name": "scrim",
              "fill": "#0A1C4D8C",
              "width": 1199,
              "height": 692
            },
            {
              "type": "group",
              "id": "tdT55",
              "x": 120,
              "y": 88,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kDE5S",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 0,
                  "name": "label",
                  "fill": "#9FB6CC",
                  "content": "CHAPTER 01",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": 3
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AzklC",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 33,
                  "name": "h",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 493,
                  "content": "強い香りが、苦手だった。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "I1Q9B",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 104,
                  "name": "en",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFFB3",
                  "content": "I was never at ease with strong fragrances.",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                  "fontSize": 9,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bzOLs",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 151,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "私は以前から、香りの強いシャンプーや洗顔料を使うと、くしゃみや鼻水が出ることがありました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IG0O7",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 229,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "香りは製品を選ぶ楽しみの一つですが、毎日使うものの香りが負担になる人もいます。私自身が、その一人でした。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YwV7h",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 307,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "無香料の製品を探すようになりましたが、すでにある無香料シャンプーは、泡立ちが物足りなかったり、洗髪中や洗い流した後に髪のきしみを感じたりすることがありました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LOeU4",
                  "x": 0,
                  "y": 414,
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "#D8E0EE",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container(445)",
                  "content": "「無香料だから、ある程度は仕方がない」そう思いながら選ぶことに、違和感がありました。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.95,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
