                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "mOV9K",
                      "name": "label",
                      "fill": "#9FB6CC",
                      "content": "CHAPTER 04",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": 3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "K8RFs",
                      "name": "h",
                      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "シャンプーの本質を、\n一本に。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp-head",
                      "fontSize": 36,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ylwpJ",
                      "name": "en",
                      "fill": "#FFFFFFB3",
                      "content": "The essence of a shampoo, in a single bottle.",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-en",
                      "fontSize": 9,
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.5
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "peHd9",
                  "name": "body",
                  "width": 466,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 19,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zK0dU",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "ESIONが考えるシャンプーの本質は、必要なうるおいを守りながら、においの原因となる皮脂や汚れを洗い流すこと。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "umgXY",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "その本質を追求するために、アミノ酸系の洗浄成分を中心に、複数の成分の組み合わせを調整しました。こうして完成したのが「エシオン スカルプケア アミノシャンプー」です。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pZP1q",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "きめ細かく弾力のある泡で、髪と地肌を包み込むように洗う。髪と指の間に薄い泡の層ができ、その上を指が滑るような、なめらかな洗い心地を目指しました。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nksS5",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "コンディショニング成分やトリートメント成分を配合し、洗い流した後の指通りやまとまりにも配慮。一本で「洗う、補う、整える」オールインワン設計です。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "BcquV",
                      "name": "p",
                      "fill": "#C4D3E0",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "香りを残さず、洗い心地や仕上がりにも妥協しない。自分が使いたい、家族にも手渡せる一本が、ようやく形になりました。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.95,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-jp",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
